Error [E0433]: The result of `sum` is thrown away
  --> discarded_pure_method.jet:14:7
    |
 14 |     p.sum()
    |       ^^^
 Why: `sum` is pure (it has no effects and changes nothing through `&`), so this line does nothing
 Fix: Use the result, bind it with `result :: sum`, or write `.drop("reason")` if dropping it is intended
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0433
